FREE TIER
You may install and use the free commands ("Check this file for year-bound
constants", "Check only the selected lines", "List the rules that ship inside")
without a licence key, for personal or commercial work, on any number of
machines, for as long as you like. No sign-up, no telemetry, no time limit.

LICENSED TIER
The workspace scan, re-check on save, report export, CI report and custom-rule
commands require a valid licence key. One licence covers one natural person on
any number of their own machines. A licence key must not be shared, resold or
published.

VALIDATION
The extension sends only the licence key you typed and a public organization id
to api.polar.sh to check whether the key is still valid. It sends no source
code, no file names and no telemetry. A key that has validated once keeps
working offline for 30 days.

REFUND
Within 7 days of purchase, ask and the purchase is refunded in full.

NO WARRANTY
This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It reports
where year-bound constants appear in your code. It does not tell you what the
correct value is, and it is not tax, legal or accounting advice. You remain
responsible for verifying every figure against its issuing authority.
